# 懵然不知
(pos: 形容詞)
<explanation>
yue:形容人唔知情，對件事毫無概念，或者對發生嘅事完全唔知情。
eng:unaware; oblivious
<eg>
yue:佢對件事完全懵然不知，等我同佢講咗先至知。 (keoi5 deoi3 ge6 si6 wun6 jung5 mong2 jin4 bat1 zi1, dang2 ngo5 tung4 keoi5 gong2 zo2 sin1 zi3 zi1.)
eng:He was completely unaware of the matter until I told him.

<eg>
yue:我哋已經計劃咗，佢都懵然不知。 (ngo5 dei6 ji1 jin3 hon2 zo2, keoi5 dou mong2 jin4 bat1 zi1.)
eng:We had already planned it, but he was completely oblivious.
 [end of text]


